Package: sgk-voice-typer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, wl-clipboard, python3-pyqt6, python3-evdev, libportaudio2
Recommends: nvidia-cuda-toolkit
Description: Push-to-talk voice input daemon for Linux / GNOME Wayland
 VoiceTyper transcribes speech to text with faster-whisper on the GPU and
 types the result into the focused window. Hold a key, speak, release: the
 text appears where the cursor is. Wayland-only, using evdev for the
 push-to-talk key and a uinput virtual keyboard for the paste.
